type: software
title: "CMPSBL OS Substrate: Cognitive Orchestration System for Autonomous AI Evolution"
version: 8.0.0
date-released: 2026-02-09
abstract: >-
  The CMPSBL OS Substrate is a cognitive orchestration system that provides 
  persistent memory, autonomous learning, multi-provider AI routing, and 
  verifiable self-evolution for artificial intelligence systems. The substrate 
  implements 269 capabilities across 14 modules, 147 synergy pipelines, and a 
  three-tier autonomy governance model with cryptographic evolution stamps.
keywords:
  - cognitive architecture
  - autonomous AI
  - self-evolution
  - AI governance
  - verifiable computing
  - multi-agent systems
  - persistent memory
  - dreaming AI
